  "summary": "Bouncy Castle has an LDAP injection",
  "details": "Improper neutralization of special elements used in an LDAP query ('LDAP injection') vulnerability in Legion of the Bouncy Castle Inc. BC-JAVA bcprov on all (prov modules). This vulnerability is associated with program files LDAPStoreHelper.\n\nIssue affecting: BC 1.74 to 1.80.1, BC 1.81, BC 1.82 to BC 1.83.\n\nFixed versions: BC 1.80.2, BC 1.81.1, BC 1.84",
